  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Required Area $=\\int_{y=0}^8 y^{1 / 3} d y$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/HuoO0VjglnVZ08iD6g8Yyb60kYp5Z-KsYUbkpPB13HA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\left.\\frac{y^{1 / 3+1}}{\\frac{1}{3}+1}\\right|_0 ^8=\\left.\\frac{3}{4}\\left(y^{4 / 3}\\right)\\right|_0 ^8 \\\\\n& =\\frac{3}{4}\\left[(8)^{4 / 3}-0\\right]=\\frac{3}{4}\\left[2^4\\right] \\\\\n& =\\frac{3}{4} \\times 16=12 \\text { sq. unit. }\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
